# Security Notes

# NEVER commit:
# - .env files (contains API keys, DB keys)
# - Model files (610KB ONNX - too large, use LFS or external storage)
# - Dataset images (~38K color images)
# - Production keys
#
# For large files, consider:
# - Git LFS: git lfs track "*.onnx"
# - External storage: models/artifacts/ from shared drive